Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swack, I know you'll stand by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.74,0:01:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.98,0:01:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.01,0:01:54.93,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,790)}Enter: Captain Usopp
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.01,0:01:54.93,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,790)}Enter: Captain Usopp
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no way we'll make\Nit to the Grand Line in this condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, we're going to\Nneed a whole lot more meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating fruit every day is for the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll also need some booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you boneheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line's a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need more than beer\Nand meat to survive there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the place is crawling with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates who are also in\Nsearch of the one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they all have ships that\Nare way better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we don't have a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any equipment or\Neven a real ship for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way we'll\Never make it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, we'll need a cook and maybe\Na musician to keep us entertained.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.94,0:02:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A musician?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little to the south of here is an\Nisland with some settlements on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like we might\Nbe able to get our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some of the supplies we need there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh meat at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of booze as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here and they're\Ngonna kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates, pirates. Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their bloodlust is unquenchable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh... LIE!
