Dialogue: 3,0:03:33.61,0:03:37.36,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,477)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Usopp\NA Village Youngster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try and catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, slowpokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he got away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's a Newgate troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd better hope I\Nnever get a hold of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like nobody's getting\Na hold of him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet another job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my solemn duty to send the wind of\Nexcitement through this boring old village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bid you good morning, Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, your loyal crew, the\NUsopp Pirates have arrived.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.09,0:04:43.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Carrot and Pepper\NVillage Boys
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.09,0:04:43.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Carrot and Pepper\NVillage Boys
Dialogue: 3,0:04:40.09,0:04:43.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Carrot and Pepper\NVillage Boys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper! Carrot! It's just you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him around today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound the alarm! They're\Nhere! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here and they're\Ngonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's freaking out about.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.91,0:05:09.83,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,477,\1a&H00&)}Onion\NA Village Boy
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.91,0:05:09.83,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,477,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Onion\NA Village Boy
Dialogue: 3,0:05:03.91,0:05:09.83,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(477,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Onion\NA Village Boy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloodthirsty murderers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Lincoln run, everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to have my snack. You chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm sick. Yeah, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I don't eat my snackiosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always told us that\Nyou wanted to become
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a real pirate someday\Nand now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a pirate is\Nafraid of other pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, it\Nwas Buggy the Clown's mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I only saw two tiny boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there were just three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's go time, brave Usa pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do have a village to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, men! Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels good to be on dry land again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a village around\Nhere somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a small one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.11,0:06:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be a place to\Neat meat in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just forget about meat\Nfor a minute, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, we're being watched.\NHuh? By who? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to be\Nwhen we're impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Usopp, leader of the invincible nation\Nof pirates who reign over this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stand before a living legend, the\Nmost revered pirate who ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the great Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you know that plotting an attack\Non this island would mean certain death?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My army of 80 million super mean pirate\Nsoldiers would squash you like bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect us to believe that? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have been so dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I practically told her I was lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot, I'm so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, you crafty tactician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eighty million may have\Nbeen an exaggeration,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have a great many\Nmen under my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you guys going? Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, or I'll shut it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a proud man, and I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last warning, or you'll\Nget to see why they call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proud Usopp, and not pushover Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already seen for yourself\Njust how good I am with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you know I can rival\Nanyone carrying a pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've drawn your\Npistol, are you willing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guns aren't for threats,\Nthey're for actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to risk your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates definitely\Nhave a lot more punch behind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their words because they\Ncan actually back them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole those words from\NRed-Haired Shanks, a pirate I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know Red-Haired Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a real pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you've got to be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really know him? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your dad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Yasopp, right? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old man's name is Yasop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world do you know him?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.41,0:10:06.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)}{Village Restaurant - Funi}Village Diner{Z - does this need a glossary entry?}
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.41,0:10:06.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}{Village Restaurant - Funi}Village Diner{Z - does this need a glossary entry?}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:02.41,0:10:06.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}{Village Restaurant - Funi}Village Diner{Z - does this need a glossary entry?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I met your dad when\NI was just a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, does my old\Nman really know Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I met your dad, he\Nwas part of Shanks' crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they were probably pretty good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old man's sailing the high\Nseas with famous pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard from him in a while,\Nbut I bet he's still with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a heck of a sharpshooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd keep him on my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Good shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, that's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could shoot an ant between\Nthe eyes from across town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know something, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a kid named Usopp, and\Nhe's just about your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told me about him\Nalready, a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It broke my heart to\Nleave, but I had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Luffy, when the pirate flag\Nbeckons, you must hate its call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to go on and on\Nand on about his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I heard enough about\Nyou to make my ears bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you,\Nhe was a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure am proud of my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He leapt into a pirate's\Nlife on the endless sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And chose a life of real adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know someone who could\Nprovide us with a decent ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even anyone who knows\Nhow to sail for that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a pretty small village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I just don't think\Nwe'll be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about that huge mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one on top of that hill over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know the Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all that money, surely\Nthey can help us get our boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I just remembered something\Nthat I really gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows me at this place,\Nso stay and eat as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why was he in such a\Nhurry to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is\Nthe place they took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those terrible\Npirates dragged him inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now it's up to us to save our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But guys, those are real pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if they've grilled\Nand eaten him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's grizzly old witch hag to\Neat their victims, not pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the most brutal\Nand epic battle of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must show no mercy because\Nthey'll never show it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Usopp pirates have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp is gone. Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice up, you filthy pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done with\Nour beloved captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That meat sure was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These pirates are cannibals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done, you savages?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for your captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you punks looking at me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just had to say\Nsomething stupid, didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}Village Mansion
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Village Mansion
Dialogue: 3,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Village Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish to see Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start this again.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.49,0:14:06.49,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Kaya\NMansion Owner
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.49,0:14:06.49,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Kaya\NMansion Owner
Dialogue: 3,0:14:03.49,0:14:06.49,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Kaya\NMansion Owner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like talking to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.53,0:14:11.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)}Klahadore\NMansion Butler
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.53,0:14:11.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Klahadore\NMansion Butler
Dialogue: 3,0:14:06.53,0:14:11.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Klahadore\NMansion Butler
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is without a\Ndoubt a chronic liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For someone in your weakened state,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp's outlandish stories\Nmight be too much to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your late parents instructed me to protect\Nyou to the fullest of my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be against their wishes\Nfor you to see him, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll leave your medicine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be sure to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killjoy will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A name I'll bear if you are kept safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you came! Of course. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem a little down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of talking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:15:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to invite you\Ninside like a proper guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's just no way\NKaido would ever allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad person, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm a brave warrior of the sea\Nwho likes endless oceans and the open sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Houses weren't made for rogues like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd probably just feel cramped in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what adventure are you\Ngoing to tell me about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the story of me\Nfighting a giant goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the South Pole when I\Nwas only five years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant goldfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What first astounded me was\Nthe immense size of its poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so big that when I landed on\Nit, I thought it was solid ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if our captain ran out for this hour,\Nthen this is the place he's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what in the world\Ndoes Usopp come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He comes to lie. To lie? That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's great, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is a liar awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Kaya,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the girl who lives there has been\Nin a terrible depression that's kept
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her weak and in bed since her\Nparents got sick and died a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's very rich, but all that money\Ncouldn't help her recover from her sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So our captain tells us special made-up\Nstories to make her laugh and cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain herself is the\Nbest at telling lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that really is pretty nice of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best thing about him\Nis his mischievous side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like him because he's\Nnot afraid to be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I like the captain's crazy lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when he tells her those\Nstories, he makes her feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, lots better. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should ask\Nher for a ship after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting in is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guards at the gate\Ndon't let anyone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ask him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after that terrifying and\Ntraumatic little incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we escaped into the sky riding\Non a giant slingshot ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That worked well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't mind them, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This happens to me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the price of\Nbeing a famous adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just new recruits who heard about\Nme and came to join the Usoppirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.94,0:17:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A favor from me? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if there was any\Nway you could help us get a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klahadore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that this\Nis criminal trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about this\Nriffraff after they've left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave now, unless you have\Nsome business with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, do you think you\Ncould help us get a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certainly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have quite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are very well known in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive for\Nsomeone as young as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually people who admire\Nme so much call me Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's Captain Usopp to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father also had something\Nof a reputation. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be anything more\Nthan the son of a filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what sort of\Ntrouble you're up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ask is that you and your kind\Nleave this respectable young lady alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A filthy pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and she are from completely\Ndifferent worlds, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it money you're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize this at once, Klahadore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe there is any reason to\Napologize to this savage young man, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal isn't to slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am merely stating the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sympathize with your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must hate your\Ngreat idiot of a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For abandoning his family and his village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of his mindless lust for treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cladador, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare insult\Nmy father ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you gotten so worked up, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's times like these when you\Nshould do what you do best and lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about how your father\Nis really a traveling salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or about how you aren't\Nreally related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Case in point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He resorts to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the apple never falls\Nfar from the tree, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father listened to his heart and\Nchose a life of risk and adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am proud to say that my old man\Nis a brave warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I have been known\Nto exaggerate from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I will never lie\Nabout who my father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be ashamed of my heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the son of a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are brave warriors\Nof the sea, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a twisted\Nway of putting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to understand that you\Nare living proof of his savage blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You run around spouting lies and use\Nviolence when you don't get your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To top it off, you cozy up to the lady\Nof the house to steal her fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father is a filthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Newgate pirate Treachery\Nis in your blood Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have such an evil\Nscheme You won't let up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Usopp, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more violence, I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lahador isn't a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just, he's just trying to\Ndo what he thinks is best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sometimes he goes too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are never to come here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me twice, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last you'll ever see of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you butler jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our captain's not that kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid jerk face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you don't have\Na bone to pick with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.52,0:22:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull me down, pull me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will all leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your meal is ready now, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.32,0:22:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cook would be most\Nupset to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He works his hardest day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To come up with delicious\Nmeals that suit your needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were you so cruel to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I was wrong to talk\Nto Usopp without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will admit that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm very sorry for\Nnot being honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this situation did not\Nwarrant that harsh treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been quite some time since\NI first arrived at this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be three years that I have\Nbeen in the service of your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forget what happened when\NI showed up at your father's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.86,0:23:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My former employers were\Nbrutal, pitiless men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd been kicked off the ship I worked\Non for some small blunder I had made,?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with no work or money, I was on\Nthe verge of dying like a beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, I would have\Ndied without your father's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe my life to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that they're gone,\NI owe my life to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.38,0:24:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it isn't my place to\Ninterfere with your friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.86,0:24:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have taken such a bold step\Nunless I thought it absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that Usopp isn't exactly\Nknown for his upstanding character.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.00,0:24:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if anything were to happen to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.06,0:24:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be my fault for\Nnot seeing to your safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.18,0:24:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I would never be able to ask\Nforgiveness from your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.68,0:24:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think ill of me for my\Nchildish behavior earlier today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.20,0:24:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful to have you\Naround too, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.30,0:24:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I stand by my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp is one of the nicest people I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.18,0:25:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, he is still not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klahadore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.74,0:25:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blockhead will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.26,0:25:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd Luffy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably ran after that captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's at his secret spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, over by the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.68,0:25:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always goes there when he's\Ngonna think something over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy can take care of himself,\Nbut where's your other friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.68,0:25:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he just\Nup and disappears a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.38,0:25:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and then he shows up out\Nof nowhere all freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrible news, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.78,0:25:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some nut job is on his way here\Nand he only walks backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.38,0:25:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.38,0:25:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:26:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now which one of you people\Nhas the nerve to call me weird?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.62,0:26:04.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Jango\NA Hypnotist
Dialogue: 2,0:25:59.62,0:26:04.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Jango\NA Hypnotist
Dialogue: 3,0:25:59.62,0:26:04.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Jango\NA Hypnotist
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.57,0:26:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.82,0:26:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary\Nrun-of-the-mill hypnotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hypnotist? Really? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.42,0:26:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.22,0:26:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.44,0:26:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that I\Nwould want to reveal my masterful
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hypnosis techniques to a\Nbunch of roadside strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.14,0:26:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you convinced me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.86,0:26:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now watch the ring closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.38,0:26:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.36,0:26:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, by the count of Django,\Nyou'll be in a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.68,0:26:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.54,0:26:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.46,0:26:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this freaky weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to be alone, but\NI guess that's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.92,0:26:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.18,0:26:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.64,0:27:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.64,0:27:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insulting my old man like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hate that guy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.86,0:27:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says,\NYasopp was a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.94,0:27:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.85,0:27:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always looked up to my old man for\Nliving every day with his life on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out in the open ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.86,0:27:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made a brave choice\Nand I admire him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.58,0:27:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then that stupid snotty\Nbutler stomped all over my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.14,0:27:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.60,0:27:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if you're ever\Ngoing to see that girl again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.38,0:27:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.82,0:27:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it if that butler\Napologizes to me for the things he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That butler right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.06,0:27:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the one. If he...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is he doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.72,0:27:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a big idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:28:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jango, I specifically ordered\Nyou to keep yourself inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean sleeping in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.04,0:28:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've perfected the\Nskills of the chameleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.78,0:28:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.24,0:28:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone else with\Nhim, and man, is he weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.12,0:28:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.50,0:28:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, have all the necessary\Npreparations been made?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.02,0:28:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can start any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the rich girl murder plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.28,0:28:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:29:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.78,0:29:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.98,0:29:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.44,0:29:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.06,0:29:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.30,0:29:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.20,0:29:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.50,0:29:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.62,0:29:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.16,0:29:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

